// Build settings shared by every Zarp target (project.yml points each configuration at this file).
//
// Machine-specific overrides — in practice your Apple Development Team ID — go in Local.xcconfig,
// which is git-ignored. Copy Local.xcconfig.example to create it. Without one the project still builds
// (CI does exactly that, unsigned); it just cannot produce a signed app that can install its daemon.

#include? "Local.xcconfig"
